{"id":161,"date":"2009-01-18T20:53:35","date_gmt":"2009-01-18T20:53:35","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=161"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:21:14","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:21:14","slug":"popularite-des-langages-de-programmation","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2009\/01\/18\/popularite-des-langages-de-programmation\/","title":{"rendered":"Popularit\u00e9 des langages de programmation"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Sur le site de TIOBE, \u00e0 http:\/\/www.tiobe.com\/index.php\/content\/paperinfo\/tpci\/index.html nous trouvons un classement de la popularit\u00e9 des langages de programmation. Ce n&rsquo;est pas une b\u00eate \u00e9tude de nombre de lignes \u00e9dit\u00e9es pour chaque langage, mais un ratio assez \u00e9labor\u00e9 d&rsquo;une recherche lanc\u00e9e sur les principaux moteurs de recherche. Des groupements sont fait pour tenir compte des r\u00e9sultats semblables. Par exemple, C et C++ ne sont pas group\u00e9s; par contre C#, <span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:18px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-indent:0;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0;\">C-Sharp, C Sharp, CSharp, CSharp.NET, C#.NET, C# 1.0, C# 2.0, C# 3.0 le sont puisque tous rel\u00e8vent de C#.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:18px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-indent:0;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0;\">Pour janvier 2008 \u00e0 2009, on rel\u00e8ve une baisse du Java (-1.83%), qui reste le leader avec 19.2% de popularit\u00e9 et une hausse de C (+2.01%), \u00e0 15.9% de popularit\u00e9. Sur la m\u00eame page, on peut y voir le graphique des 10 langages les plus courus, ceci de 2000 \u00e0 2009.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:18px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-indent:0;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0;\">Yves Masur<br \/>\n<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Sur le site de TIOBE, \u00e0 http:\/\/www.tiobe.com\/index.php\/content\/paperinfo\/tpci\/index.html nous trouvons un classement de la popularit\u00e9 des langages de programmation. Ce n&rsquo;est<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[22],"class_list":["post-161","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-programmation"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/161","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=161"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/161\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1874,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/161\/revisions\/1874"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=161"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=161"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag"